{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object, approach it, take it, check weight, do task or scan again. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />\"",
